story "harbor-quest" "归航 · 灯塔委托"
# 场景一：接入 NPC、物品栏与任务系统。emit 由宿主接收。
var coins = 3
var parcel = false
var delivered = false
var trusted = false
:: harbor
line narrator "潮水漫过旧码头。灯塔还没有亮，你握着 ${coins} 枚金币。"
line keeper "我是守灯人阿岚。暴风雨快来了，愿意帮我送一份灯芯吗？"
choice accept "接下灯芯" -> accept if !parcel && !delivered
choice buy "花两枚金币买一张航海图" -> buy if coins >= 2 && !trusted
choice lighthouse "前往灯塔" -> lighthouse if parcel
choice report "告诉阿岚灯已点亮" -> report if delivered
choice leave "搭末班船离开" -> leave
:: accept
set parcel = true
emit "quest.accepted" "lighthouse"
emit "inventory.add" "wick"
line keeper "请在涨潮前送到灯塔。不要把灯芯弄湿。"
jump harbor
:: buy
set coins = coins - 2
set trusted = true
emit "inventory.add" "chart"
line keeper "这张图标出了能避开风浪的礁石路。"
jump harbor
:: lighthouse
line narrator "你沿礁石路爬上灯塔，把灯芯交给值夜人。"
set parcel = false
set delivered = true
emit "inventory.remove" "wick"
emit "quest.completed" "lighthouse"
if trusted -> shortcut
line watchman "你走了最远的一条路，但来得正是时候。"
jump reward
:: shortcut
line watchman "看来你有阿岚的航海图。这条近路救了我们不少时间。"
jump reward
:: reward
set coins = coins + 5
emit "wallet.credit" 5
line narrator "灯塔亮了。值夜人给你五枚金币，如今你有 ${coins} 枚。"
jump harbor
:: report
line keeper "远处的船看见灯了。今晚，他们都能回家。"
end "harbor_safe"
:: leave
if delivered -> safe_departure
line narrator "船离开码头。身后的灯塔仍旧沉默，你决定明天再来。"
end "unfinished_voyage"
:: safe_departure
line narrator "你乘船离开，灯光一直照到海平线。"
end "safe_departure"
